@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 150
hide empty members
legend bottom
aggregate root: acceso a las entidades del agregado.
external reference: identidad de un objeto de otro contexto.
Las dependencias rotuladas con Id representan referencias por identificador.
Todos los value objects carecen de identidad y son inmutables.
Se validan al construirlos; una modificación crea un nuevo valor.
La igualdad compara sus atributos, salvo Timestamp (instante UTC).
CalendarDate representa una fecha válida sin hora ni zona horaria.
endlegend
title SkyCrop - Diagnóstico, Análisis, Reportes y Notificaciones
class User <<external reference>> {
-id: Long
}
class AgriculturalPlot <<external reference>> {
-id: Long
}
class Crop <<external reference>> {
-id: Long
}
class Report <<aggregate root>> {
-plotId: Long
-createdById: Long
-diagnosisIds: Set<Long>
-id: Long
-title: String
-generatedAt: Timestamp
-type: ReportType
-content: String
+generate(): void
+export(): void
+saveToHistory(): void
}
class Diagnosis <<aggregate root>> {
-plotId: Long
-imageIds: Set<Long>
-cropIds: Set<Long>
-ruleIds: Set<Long>
-id: Long
-generatedAt: Timestamp
-observations: String
-status: DiagnosisStatus
+generate(): void
+analyzeData(): void
+detectAnomaly(): Anomaly
+saveToHistory(): void
}
class TerrainData  {
-id: Long
-humidity: Decimal
-temperature: Decimal
-nutrients: String
-pH: Decimal
+update(): void
}
class AerialImage <<external reference>> {
-id: Long
}
class TerrainMap  {
-id: Long
-mapUrl: String
-generatedAt: Timestamp
-resolution: String
+generate(): void
+display(): void
}
class Anomaly  {
-id: Long
-type: AnomalyType
-severity: Severity
-description: String
-location: Location
+classify(): void
}
class AgronomicRule <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-name: Name
-description: String
-condition: String
+evaluate(): boolean
}
class DiagnosticHistory  {
-id: Long
-savedAt: Timestamp
-reference: String
+save(diagnosis: Diagnosis): void
+retrieve(): Diagnosis
}
class Notification <<aggregate root>> {
-recipientId: Long
-diagnosisId: Long [0..1]
-anomalyId: Long [0..1]
-id: Long
-message: String
-createdAt: Timestamp
-type: NotificationType
-status: NotificationStatus
+create(): void
+send(): void
+markAsRead(): void
}
interface CloudStorageService  {

+saveDiagnosis(diagnosis: Diagnosis): String
+saveReport(report: Report): String
+retrieveHistory(): String
}
interface ImageAnalysisService  {

+process(imageId: Long): Diagnosis
+analyzeTerrain(data: TerrainData): Diagnosis
+applyRules(diagnosis: Diagnosis): void
}
interface MapService  {

+generateTerrainMap(data: TerrainData): TerrainMap
}
interface WeatherService  {

+getWeather(location: Location): WeatherData
}
interface NotificationService  {

+createNotification(diagnosisId: Long, anomalyId: Long, recipientId: Long): Notification
+route(notification: Notification): void
}
interface NotificationChannel  {

+send(notification: Notification): void
}
class SMSNotificationChannel  {

+send(notification: Notification): void
}
class EmailNotificationChannel  {

+send(notification: Notification): void
}
enum ReportType {
DIAGNOSTIC
SEASONAL
}
enum DiagnosisStatus {
PENDING
PROCESSING
COMPLETED
FAILED
}
enum Severity {
LOW
MEDIUM
HIGH
CRITICAL
}
enum AnomalyType {
WATER_STRESS
PEST
FERTILIZER_DEFICIENCY
OTHER
}
enum NotificationType {
ANOMALY_DETECTED
REPORT_READY
SYSTEM_ALERT
}
enum NotificationStatus {
PENDING
SENT
READ
}
class Location <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}

}
class WeatherData <<value object>> {
-temperature: Decimal {readOnly}
-humidity: Decimal {readOnly}
-precipitation: Decimal {readOnly}
-recordedAt: Timestamp {readOnly}

}
Report ..> User : createdById
Notification ..> User : recipientId
Anomaly "1" *-- "1" Location : location
Report --> ReportType : type
Report ..> Diagnosis : diagnosisIds
Diagnosis ..> AgriculturalPlot : plotId
Report ..> AgriculturalPlot : plotId
Diagnosis "1" *-- "0..1" TerrainMap : resultMap

Diagnosis "1" *-- "0..1" TerrainData : analyzed
Diagnosis ..> AerialImage : imageIds
Diagnosis ..> Crop : cropIds
Diagnosis "1" *-- "0..*" Anomaly : detects
Diagnosis ..> AgronomicRule : ruleIds
Diagnosis "1" *-- "0..1" DiagnosticHistory : historyEntry
Diagnosis --> DiagnosisStatus : status
Anomaly --> Severity : severity
Anomaly --> AnomalyType : type
Notification ..> Diagnosis : diagnosisId / anomalyId
Notification --> NotificationType : type
Notification --> NotificationStatus : status
CloudStorageService ..> Report : stores
CloudStorageService ..> Diagnosis : stores
CloudStorageService ..> DiagnosticHistory : stores
ImageAnalysisService ..> TerrainData : analyzes
ImageAnalysisService ..> AerialImage : processes
ImageAnalysisService ..> Diagnosis : generates

ImageAnalysisService ..> AgronomicRule : applies
ImageAnalysisService ..> TerrainMap : uses
MapService ..> TerrainMap : generates
WeatherService ..> WeatherData : obtains
WeatherService ..> Location
WeatherData ..> TerrainData : provides data
NotificationService ..> Diagnosis : diagnosisId / anomalyId
NotificationService ..> Notification : creates
NotificationService ..> NotificationChannel : routes
NotificationChannel <|.. SMSNotificationChannel
NotificationChannel <|.. EmailNotificationChannel
note bottom of WeatherData
Instantánea inmutable, sin identificador.
Igualdad por todos sus atributos.
El servicio devuelve el valor; no lo posee.
end note
class Name <<value object>> {
-value: String {readOnly}
}
note right of Name
Texto no vacío después de quitar espacios externos.
Conserva caracteres y escritura del nombre.
Sin exigir cantidad de palabras.
end note
class Timestamp <<value object>> {
-value: DateTimeOffset {readOnly}
}
note right of Timestamp
Instante válido con desplazamiento horario.
Igualdad y comparación por instante UTC.
end note
AgronomicRule "1" *-- "1" Name : name
Report ..> Timestamp : temporal values
Diagnosis ..> Timestamp : temporal values
TerrainMap ..> Timestamp : temporal values
DiagnosticHistory ..> Timestamp : temporal values
Notification ..> Timestamp : temporal values
@enduml
